<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_17> <https://schema.org/name> "Section 56 of the principal Act is amended —"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_17__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_17> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
