<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Trade Unions (Amendment) Act 2007."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette, and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different provisions of this Act. Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
