<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@/~cl_20> <https://schema.org/text> "A trade union whose membership consists of workmen employed in a place of business or employment of an employer, including any division or branch of the place of business or employment and which was registered prior to 5 May 1989, being the date the term \"establishment\" as defined in section 2 of the principal Act came into operation, shall for all purposes be deemed to have been validly and lawfully registered and continue to exist as if it had been registered under the principal Act on 5 May 1989."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/30/eng@> .
